# SPEED material file of the whole Rialba mesh, materials to be set
# MATE  BLOCKID  DEGREE  RHO  VS  VP  QS  QP
# QP below VP^2/(2 VS^2) * QS, or SPEED's Y_lambda comes out negative
# (DAMPING 2 attenuates lambda): 52.5 keeps QP/QS = 1.75 of the stiffer rock
MATE 1 2 2100 400 800 40 70
MATE 2 2 2000 400 800 40 70
MATE 3 2 2000 400 800 40 70
MATE 4 2 1800 300 600 30 52.5
MATE 5 2 1800 300 600 30 52.5
# tag 6: bottom and sides, absorbing; tag 7: topography, free surface
ABSO 6
PLOZ 99 -266.384 -61.984 -242.5 -10000
FUNC 99 1 0.1 2
FMAX 3
EXPN 0.0
